$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Model Reaction. p-Cresol (41 mmol), DCTB (10 mmol), and K2CO3 (22 mmol)
were weighed into a 50 mL Erlenmeyer flask equipped with a magnetic
stirring bar, and dry DMF (20 mL) was added. This mixture was stirred for
72 h at 75 °C and poured after cooling into water (200 mL). The
precipitated product was isolated by filtration and recrystallized from
dioxane. Yield 73%. Mp 226- 228 °C, FAB: m/z = 553 Da. Elemental Analyses
Calcd for C36H28N2O4 (552.64): C, 78.2 H; H, 5.11; N, 5.07. Found: C,
77.88; H, 5.04; N 5.08%.
