$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1,2,3,4,5,6,7-Heptafluoro-8-methoxy-9H-xanthen-9-one (10) A solution of
(2,3,4,5-tetrafluoro-6-hydroxyphenyl)(2,3,4,5-tetrafluoro-6-methoxyphenyl)methanone
(9) (1.264 g, 3.40 mmol) in DMF (30 mL) was heated with cesium carbonate
(1.662 g, 5.10 mmol) at 50 °C for 1 h. DMF was then evaporated under
vacuum. The residue was treated with DCM and brine. The organic layer was
dried (MgSO4), evaporated and purified using flash chromatography
(DCM-petrol 8:2) to give
1,2,3,4,5,6,7-heptafluoro-8-methoxy-9H-xanthen-9-one (10). Pale yellow
solid, yield (0.867 g, 72%). m.p. 141-143 °C. νmax/cm-1 (ATR) 2949, 1670,
1653, 1624, 1475, 1437, 1342, 1297, 1199, 1096, 1072. δH (400 MHz, CDCl3)
4.03 (s, OCH3). δF (376 MHz, CDCl3) -141.0 (m), -144.8 (m), -145.1 (m),
-154.5 (m), -158.1 (m), -158.8 (m), -160.2 (m). m/z (APCI) Calcd. for
C14H4F7O3 ([M+H]+) 353.0043; found 353.0038.
