$DATUM ONE-POT PROCEDURE FOR THE SYNTHESIS OF 3A AND 9C,D To the vigorously
stirred mixture of pyrogallol (0.73 g, 6 mmol) and powdered K2CO3 (8.4 g,
60 mmol) in dry MeCN (60 ml) was dropped a solution of
1,3-difluoro-2,4-dinitrobenzene (1.5 g, 7.5 mmol) in MeCN (10 ml) at
ambient temperature and allowed to react for 1 h. Subsequently, PrI (5.1
g, 30 mmol), 7 or 8 (4.5 mmol), respectively, was added and refluxed for
12 h. After workup described above 3a (70%) was obtained in improved
yields. 25,27-Dipropoxy-4,6,16,18-tetranitrooxacalix[4]arene (3a) Mp
290°C (dec.). 1H NMR: δ 8.88 (s, 2H, ArH), 7.18- 7.21 (d,d, 2H, J = 7.0,
J = 9.0 Hz, ArH), 7.13 (d,d, 4H, J = 7.5,J = 1.0 Hz, ArH), 5.79 (s, 2H,
ArH), 3.88 (t, 4H, J = 6.5 Hz, OCH2), 1.35 (t,q, 4H, J = 6.5, J = 7.5 Hz,
CH2), 0.56 (t, 6H, J = 7.5 Hz, CH3). 13C NMR: δ 156.3,
146.9,143.1,131.8,125.9,125.8,121.9,102.9 (Ar), 77.1 (OCH2), 23.3 (CH2),
10.0 (CH3). anal, calcd for C30H24N4O14 (664.13): C, 54.22; H, 3.64, N,
8.43, found: C, 54.34; H, 3.66, N, 8.41%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
